From: sunshineinabox <aqemail@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] clk: qcom: gpucc-sm4450: retain GX GDSC regs across collapse

Set RETAIN_FF_ENABLE on gpu_cc_gx_gdsc so the register context survives
GDSC power collapse.

drives from this flag. Upstream made the equivalent to 
QCM2290 in commit 899dfd90229e ("clk: qcom: qcm2290: Add
RETAIN_FF_ENABLE flag for DISPCC and GPUCC GDSCs").

--- a/drivers/clk/qcom/gpucc-sm4450.c
+++ b/drivers/clk/qcom/gpucc-sm4450.c
@@ -689,5 +689,5 @@
 		.name = "gpu_gx_gdsc",
 	},
 	.pwrsts = PWRSTS_OFF_ON,
-	.flags = CLAMP_IO | AON_RESET | SW_RESET | POLL_CFG_GDSCR,
+	.flags = CLAMP_IO | AON_RESET | SW_RESET | POLL_CFG_GDSCR | RETAIN_FF_ENABLE,
 };
